    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## OptionsAhoy Equity Comp Tax Planner\n\nThis template calls the keyless OptionsAhoy optimizer (no API key) and returns the incentive stock option (ISO) exercise schedule that maximizes after-tax net final value (NFV).\n\n**Read the result at** `result.schedules.optimized.nfv`, compared against `result.schedules.lumpSum.nfv` and `result.schedules.evenSplit.nfv`.\n\n**Make it a chat agent:** replace the trigger + Set node with a Chat Trigger + an AI Agent, and attach the OptionsAhoy MCP server as a tool with an MCP Client Tool node (`serverTransport: httpStreamable`, `endpointUrl: https://optionsahoy.com/mcp`). The agent then extracts the inputs from the user and calls the optimizer.\n\nOther endpoints: `/api/v1/nso`, `/api/v1/rsu-sell-vs-hold`, `/api/v1/qsbs`, `/api/v1/concentration`, `/api/v1/protective-put`, `/api/v1/equity-funding`. Docs: https://optionsahoy.com/for-agents | Proof: https://optionsahoy.com/verification",
        "height": 360,
        "width": 420
      },
